            "summary": "Introduced herself as the new CSEA Chapter 5 president, thanked her negotiating team and district representatives for productive classified staff contract negotiations."
          },
          {
            "name": "Diana Escalante Ocon",
            "startSeconds": 233,
            "endSeconds": 408,
            "summary": "Spoke as the Adelante Selby librarian to clarify that proposed hour reductions misrepresent her schedule, explaining all time blocks are used for essential library maintenance, processing, and instruction."
          },
          {
            "name": "Devin Maligni",
            "startSeconds": 418,
            "endSeconds": 558,
            "summary": "Expressed appreciation for his school administration and support staff, and praised librarians Diana Escalante Ocon and Nancy Vias for their dedication and impact on students."
          },
          {
