            "startSeconds": 614,
            "endSeconds": 734,
            "summary": "Speaking on behalf of Orion Mandarin Immersion families, expressed support for three TK MI classes and solidarity with the co-op program in seeking a second co-op TK class, and called for community dialogue on growth data."
